      "description": "**What it shows:** Average memory use of the API and replication tasks, in percent.\n\n**Healthy:** Stable, below about 80%.\n\n**If not:** Memory that keeps going up, or stays near 100%, can make tasks run out of memory and restart. Check Replicator restarts and API running task count."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "API running task count",
      "id": 52,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "cloudwatch",
        "uid": "${DS_CW}"
      },
