      "description": "**What it shows:** How many API tasks are running. The autoscaler adds or removes tasks between the minimum and the maximum.\n\n**Healthy:** Goes up with Concurrent connections or CPU and comes back down after.\n\n**If not:** Stuck at the maximum while connections are rejected means the maximum is too low."
    },
    {
