      "description": "**What it shows:** Requests to the API through the load balancer, and how many of them failed with a server error (5xx).\n\n**Healthy:** Requests follow user activity. 5xx stays at 0.\n\n**If not:** A 5xx line above 0 means client requests fail. Read the [API] Recent logs panel."
