      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 74
      },
      "description": "**What it shows:** How many times the daily compaction task could not start (EventBridge FailedInvocations). When the task cannot start, it writes no logs.\n\n**Healthy:** 0.\n\n**If not:** Above 0 means daily compaction does not run. Check the EventBridge rule and the task's IAM role and network settings.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
